WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.511
Jeremy jumped between Ribby and the rat.

2
00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:21.250
"Go, Ribby!" he cried. "Hop away!"

3
00:00:21.251 --> 00:00:23.923
But Ribby stood still.

4
00:00:23.924 --> 00:00:27.547
"Hello, Mr. Dribber," she said calmly.

5
00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:30.348
"Have you met Jeremy?"

6
00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:33.334
Jeremy gasped.

7
00:00:33.335 --> 00:00:38.451
"Mr. Dribber is my friend," Ribby said.

8
00:00:38.452 --> 00:00:41.584
"And he's our neighbor."

9
00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:44.968
"Your friend?" Jeremy said.

10
00:00:44.969 --> 00:00:49.134
"But . . . Water rats are dangerous."

11
00:00:49.135 --> 00:00:51.812
Mr. Dribber frowned.

12
00:00:51.813 --> 00:00:55.248
"I am not dangerous," he said.

13
00:00:55.249 --> 00:00:59.341
"I only eat plants and bugs.

14
00:00:59.342 --> 00:01:02.683
I never hurt anyone!"

15
00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:07.120
The water rat disappeared in the tall grass.

16
00:01:07.121 --> 00:01:09.088
Ribby frowned.

17
00:01:09.089 --> 00:01:12.702
"Mr. Dribber is very kind, Jeremy!

18
00:01:12.703 --> 00:01:17.132
Why were you rude to him?"

19
00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:20.857
"I . . . I'm sorry," Jeremy said.

20
00:01:20.858 --> 00:01:23.546
"I was just surprised."

21
00:01:23.547 --> 00:01:26.472
Ribby didn't say anything.

22
00:01:26.473 --> 00:01:31.406
She stared down at the ground.

23
00:01:31.407 --> 00:01:35.365
"Um, Ribby," Jeremy asked.

24
00:01:35.366 --> 00:01:40.253
"Would you like to ride in my boat?"

25
00:01:40.254 --> 00:01:42.877
"No, thank you," Ribby said.

26
00:01:42.878 --> 00:01:44.846
"I do not like boats.

27
00:01:44.847 --> 00:01:46.890
They are not safe."

28
00:01:46.891 --> 00:01:50.914
"I will keep you safe," Jeremy said.

29
00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:52.904
Ribby shook her head.

30
00:01:52.905 --> 00:01:54.906
"No, thank you.

31
00:01:54.907 --> 00:02:04.704
Good-bye, Jeremy."

